# Every address a connection to this host's own port 25 can come from when the
# caller is on this host: the loopback ranges and each address of an interface.
# The port 25 service refuses them (master.cf), so a customer's process can reach
# neither the loopback nor the public address of this server with an SMTP client;
# local mail goes through sendmail and the maildrop road, which carries the
# customer's identity. A cidr table needs no index.
